      "description": "No MTA-STS policy record is published at _mta-sts.nic.in.",
      "impact": "Without MTA-STS a sending server that cannot negotiate TLS will deliver mail in plaintext rather than refusing, so an attacker positioned on the network can strip encryption and read the message.",
      "remediation": "Publish a TXT record at _mta-sts.nic.in of the form 'v=STSv1; id=<timestamp>', and serve the matching policy file at https://mta-sts.nic.in/.well-known/mta-sts.txt. Start the policy in mode: testing, then move to mode: enforce.",
